Type: Project
Title: Figures of the nrtqc-diff Analyses pages
Description: Draws the figures of the Analyses pages, and of the manuscript,
    from the CSV tables `nrtqc-diff analyse` writes. Not a package: the file
    lists the R packages the scripts use, for renv.
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    forcats,
    ggplot2,
    ggrepel,
    jsonlite,
    mapproj,
    maps,
    patchwork,
    readr,
    scales,
    svglite,
    tidyr
